izing Weapons and Armor</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get equipment by loot or crafting. Please try to aim for the most powerful equipment. There are also unique pieces of equipment that are one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster and Item Encyclopedia</h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, ingredients, literature, weapons... tons of things can be collected.</p>","developers":["BLACK PANDA"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529520/header.jpg?t=1772416288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2529520/677878/277bc8ee85738c3bb27cb7c656c6d5944a8ddeaf/1750816539/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741090569","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2529520/677878/277bc8ee85738c3bb27cb7c656c6d5944a8ddeaf/1750816539/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741090569","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2529520/677878/277bc8ee85738c3bb27cb7c656c6d5944a8ddeaf/1750816539/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741090569","id":257010160,"name":"pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257010160/61cea8966c540efde1b8ee5c430d8d69214a4a50/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741090569"}],"name":"Magical Girl Konoha","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Magical Girl Konoha - $19.99 USD","packageid":909000,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1999}],"title":"Buy Magical Girl Konoha"}],"packages":[909000